## Command Reference

### Global Options

- `--help` - Show help message and exit

### discover

Find KNX IoT devices on the network.

**Options:**

- `-t, --timeout FLOAT` - Discovery timeout in seconds (default: 5.0)
- `-s, --serialnumber TEXT` - Filter by specific serial number

### read

Read a resource from a KNX IoT device.

**Options:**

- `-h, --host TEXT` - Device IP address or hostname (required)
- `-p, --port INTEGER` - CoAP port (default: 5683)
- `-r, --resource TEXT` - Resource path, e.g., /.well-known/core (required)
- `-s, --serialnumber TEXT` - Device serial number for OSCORE (optional)
- `--security-file PATH` - Path to Project Security.csv (default: ./data/oscore_contexts/Project Security.csv)
- `--kid-context TEXT` - OSCORE Key ID Context as hex string (default: 0b)

### write

Write a value to a resource on a KNX IoT device.

**Options:**

- `-h, --host TEXT` - Device IP address or hostname (required)
- `-p, --port INTEGER` - CoAP port (default: 5683)
- `-r, --resource TEXT` - Resource path, e.g., /p/o_1_1 (required)
- `--payload TEXT` - Data to write as hex or text (required)
- `-s, --serialnumber TEXT` - Device serial number for OSCORE (required)
- `--security-file PATH` - Path to Project Security.csv (default: ./data/oscore_contexts/Project Security.csv)
- `--kid-context TEXT` - OSCORE Key ID Context as hex string (default: 0b)

### observe

Observe a resource on a KNX IoT device for real-time updates.

**Options:**

- `-h, --host TEXT` - Device IP address or hostname (required)
- `-p, --port INTEGER` - CoAP port (default: 5683)
- `-r, --resource TEXT` - Resource path, e.g., /p/o_1_3 (required)
- `-d, --duration INTEGER` - Observation duration in seconds (default: 60)
- `-s, --serialnumber TEXT` - Device serial number for OSCORE (required)
- `--security-file PATH` - Path to Project Security.csv (default: ./data/oscore_contexts/Project Security.csv)
- `--kid-context TEXT` - OSCORE Key ID Context as hex string (default: 0b)

